{"id": "holcim-2026-10-29-027", "date": "2026-10-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["holcim"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["capacity_consolidation", "capacity"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["涉及產能"]}, "title": "Holcim acquires Cem'In'Eu Group", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/HOLCIM_2021_7D_146-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>France: </strong>In its third quarter financial results, Holcim has announced the acquisition of Cem'In'Eu Group. No value for the transaction has been disclosed.</p>\n<p>Cem'In'Eu's first plant, Alienor Ciments in Tonneins, was inaugurated in 2018. Its second facility, Rhone Ciments in Portes-les-Valence, began operating in 2021. Both sites have a production capacity of 240,000t/yr of cement.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21429-holcim-acquires-cem-in-eu-group", "type": "rss"}]}
