{"id": "unknown-2026-10-29-029", "date": "2026-10-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Amrize releases financial results for the third quarter of 2026", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/amrize-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>US: </strong>Amrize has released its financial results for the third quarter of 2026, which ended on 30 September 2026. The company reported that revenues increased by 2.2% year-on-year to US$3.8bn, with net income also rising by 3.3% to US$0.56bn. Adjusted earnings before interest, taxation, depreciation and amortisation (EBITDA) increased to US$1100m.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21426-amrize-releases-financial-results-for-the-third-quarter-of-2026", "type": "rss"}]}
